title: ChaiReceipt_Start
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action approach_chai_tapri>>
ravi-anna: Regular customer. One cup?
<<wait_for_action order_chai>>
ravi-anna: One dollar. Same as yesterday. Same as tomorrow, probably.
ravi-anna: A favour. Take this notebook.
<<wait_for_action receive_notebook>>
ravi-anna: Seven days. Every cup of tea you drink — anywhere —
ravi-anna: write the cost. End of the week, we'll see something.
<<player_choose>>
-> "Sure. Seven days."
    <<set_flag accepted_chai_log>>
    <<jump ChaiReceipt_Logging>>
-> "Why? It's only a dollar."
    ravi-anna: One dollar. That is exactly why.
    ravi-anna: Big numbers we notice. Small numbers hide.
    <<set_flag accepted_chai_log>>
    <<jump ChaiReceipt_Logging>>
===

title: ChaiReceipt_Logging
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action log_chai day1 1>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day2 1>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day3 2>>
ravi-anna: Two? Two cups in one day?
<<player_choose>>
-> "Long shift."
    ravi-anna: Fine. I'm not judging. Just writing.
-> "Friend was visiting."
    ravi-anna: Friends are good. The notebook is also good.
<<continue>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day4 1>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day5 1>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day6 1>>
<<wait_for_action log_chai day7 1>>
ravi-anna: Seven days. Total?
<<wait_for_action add_total>>
ravi-anna: Eight dollars. One week. Just tea. Nothing else counted.
<<jump ChaiReceipt_Reveal>>
===

title: ChaiReceipt_Reveal
tags:
---
ravi-anna: Now multiply by fifty-two weeks. Use the phone.
<<wait_for_action multiply 8 52>>
ravi-anna: Four hundred and sixteen dollars. One year. Just tea from one cart.
ravi-anna: Average person spends seven a day on small things. Tea. Snacks.
ravi-anna: Seven times three sixty-five. Two thousand five hundred and fifty-five a year. Gone. Sip by sip.
<<player_choose>>
-> "I should stop drinking tea."
    ravi-anna: Don't stop. I'll be sad.
    ravi-anna: Just know the number. Knowing is the whole game.
    <<set_flag chai_awareness>>
-> "Four hundred isn't that bad."
    ravi-anna: Maybe not. But now you can decide.
    ravi-anna: Before, it was a habit. Now, it is a choice.
    <<set_flag chai_awareness>>
-> "What if I drank one a day instead of two on some days?"
    ravi-anna: Smart question. Cut one a week. Fifty-two a year.
    ravi-anna: Put that in the Save envelope. Same tea, plus a budget.
    <<set_flag chai_optimised>>
<<continue>>
maya-didi: Small leaks sink ships. Big leaks are easy to see.
maya-didi: The dangerous ones are the ones you don't count.
<<grant_mastery budgeting.small-leaks 1>>
<<set_flag finished_chai_receipt>>
ravi-anna: Keep the notebook. Use it for groceries. Buses. Everything.
===
